# This is advisory: it auto-requests review and documents who is accountable
# for the high-authority paths. It is deliberately NOT paired with "Require
# review from Code Owners" in branch protection — with a single maintainer,
# a required-approval rule is a rule that gets bypassed, and a bypass habit
# erodes the required *status checks*, which are the part no human can
# substitute for. Turn the requirement on when there is a second regular
# reviewer. See docs/CONTRIBUTING.md.

